Database Interactions
The following services interact directly with the PostgreSQL database.
Service
Access Type
Operations
Data Processing Service
Write
INSERT new records into the entity_state_record and fire_event_record tables after consuming and parsing messages from Kafka.
Data Acquisition Service
Read
SELECT records from the database to fulfill client API requests for historical data, aggregations, and metrics.

